// Clefairy Moon, Togetic Shiny, Doublade Dusk, Kirlia (male) and Snorunt (female) Dawn Stone. All match.
// Left for later triggers: Wurmple (personality), Tyrogue (stats), Tandemaus, friendship/trade/time/rain/party cases.
